        <mxCell id="pg-00-howto-c-1" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;HubSpot logic map — stage 2 (LIVE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Generated 12 Oct 2026 by SystemsAnalyst from live HubSpot config read through the n8n gateway. Do not hand-edit: regenerate.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;816 flows · 510 enabled · 306 deactivated · every one read in full, including its action graph and enrolment criteria.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="-150" width="1700" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-00-howto-c-2" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 · Provenance is the border and the bracket tag — never colour&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Repo README rule 3, and PRO-36&amp;#x27;s convention. Colour already carries meaning in the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;operator&amp;#x27;s own map, so overloading it would destroy both signals.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━━ solid green, thick   [VERIFIED 12 Oct 2026]  read from live HubSpot config&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8A5300&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;┅┅┅ dashed amber         [CACHE 1 Sep 2026]      from the stale n8n extract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6A3FB5&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;┈┈┈ dotted purple        [OPERATOR]              operator&amp;#x27;s claim, not machine-checked&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;━ ━ dashed red, thick    [BLIND SPOT]            known gap — nothing was read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#1F6E43;strokeWidth=3;dashed=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="820" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-00-howto-c-3" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2 · Fill carries state. The lane is the page.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;white    enabled flow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot;&gt;grey     deactivated flow — drawn in the place it would have run&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;pale red carries a dead end (see page 15)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6A3FB5&quot;&gt;lilac    an asset: list, form, property, landing page&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;blue     an n8n workflow&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;At 816 boxes, ON-vs-OFF has to read at a glance, so fill is state and the page is the lane.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#1F6E43;strokeWidth=3;dashed=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="880" y="20" width="820" height="210" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-00-howto-c-4" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 · Every box is a link. Click it.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;A flow box opens that flow in HubSpot. A list, form or property box opens that asset.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;An n8n box opens the workflow. Navigation boxes jump between pages of this file.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;Portal id 21538852, proven twice independently.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;Flow URL format is VERIFIED — taken from a URL the portal itself generated.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8A5300&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;List, form and property URL formats are INFERRED — nobody here has a browser.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8A5300&quot;&gt;One click each settles them; they live in one function of the generator.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#1F6E43;strokeWidth=3;dashed=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="250" width="820" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-00-howto-c-5" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4 · Two layers. Only one of them is yours.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;generated       every box this generator emits. Replaced wholesale on each run.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6A3FB5&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;operator-notes  empty, and reserved for you.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;HONEST LIMIT: the generator still emits an EMPTY operator-notes layer every run, so&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;layer separation does NOT yet preserve your notes. The merge step does not exist.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;What does protect you: output is deterministic, so any git diff is a real upstream&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;change — and regenerations arrive as a pull request you can reject (README rule 1).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#1F6E43;strokeWidth=3;dashed=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="880" y="250" width="820" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-00-howto-c-6" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5 · Source pin — what was read, and when&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Flow config — [GATEWAY] HubSpot Read, n8n workflow fCFvIDxxSi2F4re3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;   GET /automation/v4/flows + /automation/v4/flows/{id} × 816, 0 errors&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;   read 2026-10-12T06:58:57 · gateway versionId b9418bd0&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F6E43&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;   sha256 of the canonical flow set: cefd4b5b7429e58ee83540a460ef2247&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Assets — 2310 properties, 1051 lists, 175 forms, 13 deal pipelines, 79 owners&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8A5300&quot;&gt;Drift baseline — n8n data table 47SatIDJkRTKJYRF, 767 rows @ 1 Sep 2026 (stale, never truth)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#1F6E43;strokeWidth=3;dashed=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="470" width="1660" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
