        <mxCell id="pg-02-spine-c-20" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lifecycle integrity — what to check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;HubSpot moves lifecyclestage forward automatically and never backwards.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;A custom stage inside the pipeline (&amp;#x27;Game Plan Booked&amp;#x27;) sits between the standard&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;ones, so any flow that assumes the 7 standard values will skip or strand it.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8A5300&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;This is a named gap, not a fix — see README rule 5.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#1F6E43;strokeWidth=3;dashed=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="880" y="170" width="820" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
