  <diagram id="pg-21-blind" name="21 · Blind spots &amp; what stage 3 needs">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="826" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="generated" value="generated" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="operator-notes" value="operator-notes" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-1" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;21 · What this map still cannot show you&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;README rule 5: map what exists, record what is missing as a named gap. A map that hides its own holes launders a guess into a reference.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="-150" width="1700" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-2" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ticket &amp;amp; company properties&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;403 from HubSpot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;The gateway&amp;#x27;s credential lacks the scope. /crm/v3/properties/tickets, companies, products, quotes, subscriptions, line_items and appointments all refuse. Those objects&amp;#x27; property layers are absent from page 19.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ Widen the HubSpot private-app scopes, then re-run.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-3" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Object schemas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/crm/v3/schemas returned 0 results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Flows run on custom objects 2-49225926, 2-21217427, 2-49225923, 2-49225924, 2-56668494 and 2-64252538 — but the schema endpoint returns nothing, so those objects are named by id only.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ Same scope fix; then label the custom objects.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="890" y="20" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-4" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Numeric objectTypeId reads&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;gateway allowlist regex&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;The allowlist&amp;#x27;s object segment is [A-Za-z0-9_]+ with no hyphen, so /crm/v3/properties/0-1 is refused and only name forms work. Custom objects have no name form.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ AutomationEngineer: allow a hyphen in the object segment. Not my change — I am read-only.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-5" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Marketing emails&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;not read&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;246 flows send email via a content_id. The email bodies, and any URL inside them, were never fetched. A link in an email body is still invisible.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ Add a marketing-email read to the gateway allowlist.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="890" y="230" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-6" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Installed apps / integrations list&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;not readable through this gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;The allowlist has no integrations endpoint, so dialer.io, Kixie, Zapier and Dialfire are still inferred from flow names and webhook URLs, not confirmed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ Carried from stage 1 (V10). Still open.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-7" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sequences, CTAs, ads&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;not in the flow API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Sales Sequences and CTAs are separate objects that move contacts and are absent here. One flow is triggered by an ads interaction, which proves ads reach into the estate.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ Separate reads; scope first.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="890" y="440" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-8" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Operator-note preservation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;generator limitation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;The operator-notes layer is emitted empty every run. Nothing merges your annotations forward. Layer separation is necessary and not sufficient.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ AutomationEngineer builds the merge step.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="40" y="650" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pg-21-blind-c-9" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;line-height:13px&#x27;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rendering&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C0392B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;not verified visually&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#555555&quot;&gt;Checked mechanically: well-formed XML, no duplicate ids, no dangling edges, every cell has geometry. I have no renderer and did not open this at app.diagrams.net.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2E5395&quot;&gt;→ One File → Open settles it.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=3;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="generated"><mxGeometry x="890" y="650" width="820" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
